
The favourite place I've ever been is Holbox, it is an island at the south of Mexico. The place is so nice, and 
peaceful, the water is clear and warm, and the sand is white as snow.

The ocean is beautiful there, the water is so calm, it is really shallow and there are no dangerous currents.
There is a beautiful shore that you can walk by, and enjoy one of the most incredible sunsets you could ever see.